<section class="py-32 border-t border-gray-200/50 relative z-10 px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-start">
    <!-- Left Column -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <h2 class="text-heading-32 sm:text-heading-40 font-bold text-gray-1000 tracking-tight mb-6 leading-tight">
        Lowering barriers.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-copy-15 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Student support is most effective when it is immediate. By eliminating the stigma and fear of academic or personal consequences, we make it simple for students to seek guidance.
      </p>
      <div class="border-l border-tertiary pl-4 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 italic">
        "Early peer intervention resolves over 60% of common adjustment difficulties before clinical therapy is required."
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column (Typographic Cards with No Borders) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-10">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-2">Eliminate Stigma</h3>
        <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Ask questions, discuss academic pressure, and share struggles without worrying about permanent records, labels, or social consequences.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-2">Early Support</h3>
        <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Accessible text channels encourage students to find help early in the semester, preventing minor issues from escalating.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-2">Candid Discussion</h3>
        <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Without identity barriers, student communication is honest, allowing peer mentors to provide practical guidance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-heading-16 font-bold text-gray-1000 mb-2">Mutual Trust</h3>
        <p class="text-label-13 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Complete ownership over your participation builds immediate, respectful connections between students and mentors.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
